<title>UK: UK's Eurasia says Canada's QEX launches bid.</title>
<headline>UK's Eurasia says Canada's QEX launches bid.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>British mining group Eurasia Mining Plc said on Thursday that Canada's QEX Resources Inc. had made a recommended takeover offer for Eurasia.</p>
<p>Eurasia said QEX had signed a letter of intent to bid for approximately five million Eurasia shares outstanding. Eurasia said the number of QEX shares to be offered would be announced in the near future.</p>
<p>Eurasia is listed on London's Alternative Investment Market. The shares closed at 200p on Thursday.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
